{"type": "chunks", "title": "Topic 11 · Status Games vs. Wealth Creation · Chunks", "source": "Modern Wisdom · Chris Williamson & Naval Ravikant · youtu.be/KyfUysrNaco", "audio": "audio/ch_t11/all.mp3", "items": [{"n": 1, "c": "the allure of accruing", "zh": "积累的诱惑", "s": "Satisfaction games, the allure of accruing, whether it’s fame, actual fame, or just the competition comparison trap, it’s always there.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [20, 42], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o00.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q00.mp3", "src": [876.62, 880.37], "t": 0.0, "m": [["o", 0.0], ["o", 4.43], ["o", 8.87], ["z", 13.3], ["o", 15.27], ["o", 19.71], ["o", 24.14]], "sg": [[0, 33, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 0.97, 3.49], [34, 62, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 3.49, 5.51], [63, 116, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 5.71, 8.82], [117, 135, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 8.82, 9.84]]}, {"n": 2, "c": "the competition comparison trap", "zh": "竞争与攀比的陷阱", "s": "Satisfaction games, the allure of accruing, whether it’s fame, actual fame, or just the competition comparison trap, it’s always there.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [84, 115], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o01.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q01.mp3", "src": [882.0, 884.41], "t": 28.79, "m": [["o", 28.79], ["o", 31.89], ["o", 34.98], ["z", 38.08], ["o", 40.52], ["o", 43.61], ["o", 46.71]], "sg": [[0, 33, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 0.97, 3.49], [34, 62, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 3.49, 5.51], [63, 116, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 5.71, 8.82], [117, 135, "audio/t11o/s01.mp3", 8.82, 9.84]]}, {"n": 3, "c": "swayed by social approval", "zh": "被社会认可左右", "s": "There’s a real draw of being swayed by social approval, but how should people learn to get less distracted by status games in that way?", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [29, 54], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o02.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q02.mp3", "src": [887.08, 888.44], "t": 50.07, "m": [["o", 50.07], ["o", 52.11], ["o", 54.17], ["z", 56.22], ["o", 58.53], ["o", 60.58], ["o", 62.63]], "sg": [[0, 55, "audio/t11o/s02.mp3", 0, 2.26], [56, 106, "audio/t11o/s02.mp3", 2.62, 5.46], [107, 135, "audio/t11o/s02.mp3", 5.46, 7.13]]}, {"n": 4, "c": "there was no such thing as wealth", "zh": "根本没有财富这回事", "s": "In old society, let’s go back to hunter-gatherer times, there was no such thing as wealth – you just had what you could carry.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [56, 89], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o03.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q03.mp3", "src": [903.58, 904.92], "t": 64.96, "m": [["o", 64.96], ["o", 66.99], ["o", 69.02], ["z", 71.04], ["o", 73.68], ["o", 75.71], ["o", 77.74]], "sg": [[0, 48, "audio/t11o/s04.mp3", 1.1, 2.66], [49, 91, "audio/t11o/s04.mp3", 3.14, 4.64], [92, 126, "audio/t11o/s04.mp3", 4.78, 6.39]]}, {"n": 5, "c": "a positive-sum game", "zh": "正和游戏", "s": "You can scale that product or service and you can provide abundance for a lot of people, and that’s not zero-sum, that’s a positive-sum game.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [121, 140], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o04.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q04.mp3", "src": [931.54, 932.59], "t": 80.08, "m": [["o", 80.08], ["o", 81.82], ["o", 83.55], ["z", 85.3], ["o", 87.13], ["o", 88.88], ["o", 90.61]], "sg": [[0, 18, "audio/t11o/s09.mp3", 0, 0.82], [19, 49, "audio/t11o/s09.mp3", 0.82, 1.8], [50, 88, "audio/t11o/s09.mp3", 1.8, 3.26], [89, 113, "audio/t11o/s09.mp3", 3.64, 4.6], [114, 141, "audio/t11o/s09.mp3", 5.1, 6.53]]}, {"n": 6, "c": "a ranking ladder", "zh": "排名阶梯", "s": "It’s a ranking ladder, it’s a hierarchy, and so if one person rises in status, somebody else has to lower in status.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [5, 21], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o05.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q05.mp3", "src": [946.16, 947.01], "t": 92.66, "m": [["o", 92.66], ["o", 94.21], ["o", 95.76], ["z", 97.31], ["o", 99.19], ["o", 100.74], ["o", 102.29]], "sg": [[0, 40, "audio/t11o/s14.mp3", 0, 1.58], [41, 78, "audio/t11o/s14.mp3", 2.14, 3.42], [79, 116, "audio/t11o/s14.mp3", 3.48, 4.91]]}, {"n": 7, "c": "They're always combative", "zh": "它们总是充满对抗", "s": "They’re always combative.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [0, 24], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o06.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q06.mp3", "src": [966.66, 968.02], "t": 104.1, "m": [["o", 104.1], ["o", 106.15], ["o", 108.2], ["z", 110.25], ["o", 112.75], ["o", 114.81], ["o", 116.85]], "sg": [[0, 25, "audio/t11o/s18.mp3", 0, 1.23]]}, {"n": 8, "c": "concrete material returns", "zh": "实实在在的物质回报", "s": "So I would argue that wealth creation games are both more pleasant, they’re positive-sum, and they actually have concrete material returns.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [113, 138], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o07.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q07.mp3", "src": [994.38, 996.21], "t": 119.18, "m": [["o", 119.18], ["o", 121.71], ["o", 124.24], ["z", 126.76], ["o", 129.31], ["o", 131.84], ["o", 134.37]], "sg": [[0, 28, "audio/t11o/s22.mp3", 0, 1.68], [29, 89, "audio/t11o/s22.mp3", 1.7, 4.5], [90, 139, "audio/t11o/s22.mp3", 5.38, 8.01]]}, {"n": 9, "c": "we are evolutionarily hardwired", "zh": "我们在进化上天生如此", "s": "People always want what they don’t have, and we are evolutionarily hardwired for status because as I said, wealth creation didn’t really exist until the agricultural revolution when you could store grain.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [45, 76], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o08.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q08.mp3", "src": [1020.02, 1021.85], "t": 137.11, "m": [["o", 137.11], ["o", 139.63], ["o", 142.16], ["z", 144.69], ["o", 147.62], ["o", 150.15], ["o", 152.67]], "sg": [[0, 40, "audio/t11o/s28.mp3", 0.06, 2.18], [41, 106, "audio/t11o/s28.mp3", 3.2, 6.54], [107, 176, "audio/t11o/s28.mp3", 6.54, 9.4], [177, 204, "audio/t11o/s28.mp3", 9.4, 11.23]]}, {"n": 10, "c": "it's not gonna fall on your lap", "zh": "它不会自己掉到你怀里", "s": "You still have to go find it, it’s not easy, it’s not gonna fall on your lap and you have to learn something and know something and do something interesting,", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [45, 76], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o09.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q09.mp3", "src": [1043.99, 1045.14], "t": 155.41, "m": [["o", 155.41], ["o", 157.25], ["o", 159.08], ["z", 160.91], ["o", 163.68], ["o", 165.52], ["o", 167.35]], "sg": [[0, 44, "audio/t11o/s32.mp3", 0, 1.72], [45, 89, "audio/t11o/s32.mp3", 1.76, 3.1], [90, 157, "audio/t11o/s32.mp3", 3.1, 5.57]]}, {"n": 11, "c": "almost no way out of that", "zh": "几乎没有出路", "s": "A few hundred years ago you were born a serf, you were gonna die a serf, there was almost no way out of that.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [83, 108], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o10.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q10.mp3", "src": [1055.02, 1056.28], "t": 169.5, "m": [["o", 169.5], ["o", 171.46], ["o", 173.41], ["z", 175.36], ["o", 177.39], ["o", 179.34], ["o", 181.3]], "sg": [[0, 45, "audio/t11o/s34.mp3", 0, 1.74], [46, 89, "audio/t11o/s34.mp3", 2.12, 3.38], [90, 109, "audio/t11o/s34.mp3", 3.38, 4.47]]}, {"n": 12, "c": "as you said", "zh": "正如你说的", "s": "A lot of people do that, as you said.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [25, 36], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o11.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q11.mp3", "src": [1095.42, 1096.64], "t": 183.51, "m": [["o", 183.51], ["o", 185.42], ["o", 187.33], ["z", 189.23], ["o", 191.28], ["o", 193.19], ["o", 195.09]], "sg": [[0, 37, "audio/t11o/s38.mp3", 0, 1.61]]}, {"n": 13, "c": "I hadn't thought that through", "zh": "我没想透这一点", "s": "That’s a good observation, I hadn’t thought that through, but you’re right.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [27, 56], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o12.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q12.mp3", "src": [1130.9, 1131.79], "t": 197.32, "m": [["o", 197.32], ["o", 198.92], ["o", 200.51], ["z", 202.1], ["o", 204.37], ["o", 205.97], ["o", 207.56]], "sg": [[0, 26, "audio/t11o/s48.mp3", 0.26, 1.36], [27, 75, "audio/t11o/s48.mp3", 1.44, 2.89]]}, {"n": 14, "c": "trajectory is more important than position", "zh": "走势比位置更重要", "s": "Jimmy Carr has this cool idea where he says trajectory is more important than position.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [44, 86], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o13.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q13.mp3", "src": [1173.25, 1175.27], "t": 209.37, "m": [["o", 209.37], ["o", 212.09], ["o", 214.8], ["z", 217.53], ["o", 219.98], ["o", 222.7], ["o", 225.41]], "sg": [[0, 54, "audio/t11o/s60.mp3", 0, 2.4], [55, 87, "audio/t11o/s60.mp3", 2.4, 3.95]]}, {"n": 15, "c": "stop the bleeding", "zh": "止血", "s": "Something that is bleeding eventually dies, unless you stop the bleeding, so you’re hardwired not to lose what you have.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [55, 72], "o": "audio/ch_t11/o14.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t11/q14.mp3", "src": [1194.4, 1195.32], "t": 228.34, "m": [["o", 228.34], ["o", 229.96], ["o", 231.58], ["z", 233.21], ["o", 234.54], ["o", 236.15], ["o", 237.77]], "sg": [[0, 43, "audio/t11o/s64.mp3", 0, 1.68], [44, 73, "audio/t11o/s64.mp3", 1.94, 2.92], [74, 120, "audio/t11o/s64.mp3", 3.14, 5.93]]}]}